WEBVTT

00:00:00.366 --> 00:00:02.400
hi there! with Nova Imago

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.200
you can get professional headshots in just 30 minutes

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.700
let me show you how it works

00:00:06.866 --> 00:00:09.500
go to the dashboard and select train a model

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.100
fill in the form

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.633
and select the options that describe you best

00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:16.266
like gender ethnicity,

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.500
hair colour, eye colour

00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:21.166
maybe you wear glasses or maybe you're bald

00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:24.600
then continue to upload your selfies

00:00:24.866 --> 00:00:28.066
first read the tips carefully to get the best results

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.900
upload your photos

00:00:29.966 --> 00:00:32.866
you can add or remove pictures anytime

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.733
and then start the AI training

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.966
during the training you can leave this page

00:00:40.966 --> 00:00:43.666
we'll send you an email as soon as it's finished

00:00:44.633 --> 00:00:46.100
once the training is done

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.066
you can generate your photos

00:00:48.566 --> 00:00:51.966
choose the styles you want and then click continue

00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:58.300
here you can pick the format

00:00:58.633 --> 00:01:01.466
you'll also see how many pictures you will generate

00:01:01.466 --> 00:01:03.700
and how many credits it will take

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.566
when your professional headshots are ready

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.666
you'll find them in your gallery

00:01:08.866 --> 00:01:10.966
just select the ones you like

00:01:10.966 --> 00:01:14.500
and download them to your device. thank you for watching!
